flowchart TB
  HOST[Local Workstation / Server]
  UI[Web UI / CLI]
  CORE[manuscript-core environment\nAPI • orchestrator • schemas • policy]
  WORK[agent-work environment\nliterature • writing • review • QA]
  SCI[scientific-tools environment\nNumPy • SciPy • ASE • pymatgen • domain parsers]
  LLM[local-llm environment\nmodel runtime • tokenizer • inference]
  DOC[document-tools environment\nLaTeX • Pandoc • PDF parsing • rendering]
  DB[(PostgreSQL / SQLite project DB)]
  OBJ[(Filesystem artifact store\ncontent-addressed + immutable raw/)]
  IDX[(Vector index)]
  OBS[Structured logs + audit events]
  GIT[Git repository + DVC/LFS or equivalent]
  EXT[Optional network adapters\nmetadata APIs only, allowlisted]

  HOST --> UI
  HOST --> CORE
  HOST --> WORK
  HOST --> SCI
  HOST --> LLM
  HOST --> DOC
  CORE <--> DB
  CORE <--> OBJ
  CORE <--> OBS
  CORE <--> GIT
  WORK <--> DB
  WORK <--> OBJ
  WORK <--> IDX
  WORK --> LLM
  WORK --> SCI
  WORK --> DOC
  CORE --> EXT

  subgraph REPO[Repository Boundaries]
    AG[agents/]
    DOMAIN[domain/\nclaim • evidence • manuscript • journal]
    INFRA[infra/\nstorage • queue • model gateway • adapters]
    CFG[configs/ • schemas/ • prompts/]
    TEST[tests/ • fixtures/ • golden cases]
    PROJ[projects/<project_id>/\nraw • artifacts • reports • releases]
  end

  CORE --> DOMAIN
  WORK --> AG
  CORE --> INFRA
  CORE --> CFG
  CORE --> TEST
  OBJ --> PROJ
